Tasks use the Task issue form. Pull requests follow `.github/pull_request_template.md`. Rules for people and AI tools are in `AGENTS.md`.

## Standard

This repository follows `{{standard}}` with the `{{profile}}` profile. `AGENTS.md` is generated, so do not edit it by hand. To regenerate it or run the check locally:

```bash
pip install pyyaml
git clone --depth 1 --branch {{ref}} https://github.com/{{standard_repo}} .standards
python .standards/scripts/standard.py agents .
python .standards/scripts/standard.py check .
```

